Environment variable: `MOOSA_WORKER_TO_CONSOLE_SECRET`

• Generated once, stored identically in both `.env` files
• Worker uses it as `X-MOOSA-SECRET` request header
• Console validates it before processing any system message
• Not exposed to browser, not stored in conversations.json metadata key

